    {
        "content": "<p>Hello everyone. I formalized a small Lean 4 <a href=\"https://github.com/Arij-Aziz/Sieve-majorant-improvement\">project</a> around the single-prime Selberg majorant ν on Fin(d·m) with AI assistance. </p>\n<p>Three properties are proved: (1) a Cauchy–Schwarz restriction lower bound on any nonneg dominating majorant, (2) a pointwise Lipschitz stability bound for multiplicative density functions under prime-level perturbation, and (3) the normalized L² norm equals 1 − 3/(4d), which coincides with the Selberg quadratic form Q(λ) at the optimal weight λ_d = −1/2 in this model. The scope is the single-prime case only.</p>\n<p>You can find the project <a href=\"https://github.com/Arij-Aziz/Sieve-majorant-improvement\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>here is the complete url in case the link does not work.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Arij-Aziz/Sieve-majorant-improvement\">https://github.com/Arij-Aziz/Sieve-majorant-improvement</a></p>\n<p>Lean is not my strong suite so any comment will help and be greatly appreciated.</p>",
        "id": 599757884,
        "sender_full_name": "Arij Aziz",
        "timestamp": 1780483240
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It's completely unauditable. What is your main statement? Is the stateable using only Mathlib imports? Where is it? Have you checked your proof under comparator? Do you have a <code>formalization.yml</code>?</p>\n<p>Without clear answers to these questions a project like this is just slop.</p>",
        "id": 599967468,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1780537611
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>having a model (or multiple) audit and critique the project first is a good way to find out if this is likely to prove anything useful. codex thinks there are pretty major gaps.</p>",
        "id": 599984133,
        "sender_full_name": "Nathan Howell",
        "timestamp": 1780543870
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110087\">Kim Morrison</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/599967468\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's completely unauditable. What is your main statement? Is the stateable using only Mathlib imports? Where is it? Have you checked your proof under comparator? Do you have a <code>formalization.yml</code>?</p>\n<p>Without clear answers to these questions a project like this is just slop.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Hi. First of all, I am sorry for for not adding formalization.yml file. I have updated the project.<br>\nTo answer you questions. <br>\nYes, it only use Mathlib imports.<br>\nAnd yes, it has been checked under comparator.</p>\n<p>the main statement is<br>\n<strong>The single-prime Selberg majorant on <code>Fin(d·m)</code> simultaneously achieves strict mass and L² improvement over the constant baseline, and its normalized L² norm equals the Selberg quadratic form evaluated at the optimal single-prime weights.</strong></p>\n<p>it is checked here. In <code>RequestProject/Audit.lean</code><br>\n#print axioms sieveMajorant_l2NormSq_eq_selbergForm<br>\n#print axioms selbergComparison_dual_improvement</p>\n<p>The readme has been updated to reflect the changes and claims.</p>\n<p>Thank you for giving it the intial reveiw and i hope you are willing to review it again.</p>",
        "id": 600083395,
        "sender_full_name": "Arij Aziz",
        "timestamp": 1780578496
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"969501\">Nathan Howell</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/599984133\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>having a model (or multiple) audit and critique the project first is a good way to find out if this is likely to prove anything useful. codex thinks there are pretty major gaps.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>thank you for the advice. I did exactly that and updated the readme to have much stricter claims which resolved many issues the models flagged and resolved the minor ones as well. I also added the build.yml file to show the project compiles independently.</p>\n<p>if you have any more advice, i will be happy to hear.</p>",
        "id": 600092902,
        "sender_full_name": "Arij Aziz",
        "timestamp": 1780580929
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1070783\">Arij Aziz</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/600092902\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>if you have any more advice, i will be happy to hear.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>try using a prompt like this with a frontier model (Opus/Codex) in extra-high thinking:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">You</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reviewing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mathematical</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">formalization</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repository</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rely</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">README</span><span class=\"bp\">’</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claims</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Independently</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">determine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">what</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repo</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">actually</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proves</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substantive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">what</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gaps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remain</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Work</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">external</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sources</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">necessary</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">edit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Tasks</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Inspect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">layout</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`git</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">--short`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tracked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Identify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">audit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">metadata</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">generated</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">untracked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">artifacts</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verification</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">If</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repo</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">If</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">infer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">project</span><span class=\"bp\">’</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">docs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Record</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succeeds</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fails</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succeeds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">warnings</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hygiene</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Search</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`sorry</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`admit</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`axiom</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`unsafe</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Assumed</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`TODO</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`FIXME</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equivalent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">placeholders</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Distinguish</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">between</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tracked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">future</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">scaffolding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">comments</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dependencies</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">If</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">an</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">axiom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">audit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exists</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">imported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">summarize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reported</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">axioms</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substance</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Identify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">named</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theorems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">For</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">each</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">summarize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">statement</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">README</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Separate</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">concrete</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instantiated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abstract</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">conditional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lemmas</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">restatements</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elementary</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inequalities</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scaffolding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aspirational</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">future</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">work</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Scope</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Compare</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">README</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">metadata</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claims</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">against</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">statements</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Identify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">concrete</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">models</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sanity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">checks</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reusable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">infrastructure</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">genuinely</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substantive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">domain</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"n\">results</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pay</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">special</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">attention</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">are</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conditional</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hypotheses</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">contain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">part</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">any</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nontrivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instantiated</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathematical</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gaps</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">what</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">would</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">still</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">needed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">project</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">its</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">strongest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claims</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">For</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sieve</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">formal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">number</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repos</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">things</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">like</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">multi</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prime</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">divisor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">systems</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">optimized</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">asymptotics</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remainder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">terms</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">level</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">distribution</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nontrivial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">applications</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">extremality</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">minimality</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claims</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fourier</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">pseudorandom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hypotheses</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">restriction</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">transference</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claimed</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">7.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">quality</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Note</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">broken</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">README</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">commands</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">missing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`.</span><span class=\"n\">gitignore</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">untracked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">generated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">warnings</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stale</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nested</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copies</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">issues</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">confusing</span>\n<span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"n\">project</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">format</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">short</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verdict</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">“</span><span class=\"n\">proves</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">something</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substantive</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"bp\">”</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">“</span><span class=\"n\">mostly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toy</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"bp\">”</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">“</span><span class=\"n\">useful</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">infrastructure</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"bp\">”</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">similar</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">give</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">concise</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evidence</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hygiene</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scope</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">strongest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">useful</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">parts</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">major</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gaps</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">references</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">claims</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rude</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">but</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">direct</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Avoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">accepting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">marketing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">language</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">supports</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">End</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">short</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">author</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">sendable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">summary</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">focused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">constructive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gaps</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
