    {
        "content": "<p>And note that the <code>automation</code> field is a required field in formalization.yml: <a href=\"https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formalization.yaml/blob/fab03cbbed1a5857de17af32de30421a734c77c6/formalization.yaml#L43\">https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formalization.yaml/blob/fab03cbbed1a5857de17af32de30421a734c77c6/formalization.yaml#L43</a></p>",
