        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"246273\">Bhavik Mehta</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/600523982\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And note that the <code>automation</code> field is a required field in formalization.yml: <a href=\"https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formalization.yaml/blob/fab03cbbed1a5857de17af32de30421a734c77c6/formalization.yaml#L43\">https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formalization.yaml/blob/fab03cbbed1a5857de17af32de30421a734c77c6/formalization.yaml#L43</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Thank you for providing a detailed format for how the the formalization.yml should look like. I have updated the file accordingly which also reflects AI usage.</p>",
