    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110087\">Kim Morrison</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/600523616\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is there a file that has only Mathlib imports containing some or all of the <em>statements</em>, without proofs, of the results you claim to prove? Without this, no, the project is not auditable.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Yes, I have added a new file \"Statements\" which has the main 20 theorems stated with only Mathlib import. The <a href=\"https://github.com/Arij-Aziz/Sieve-majorant-improvement/blob/main/RequestProject/Statements.lean\">pathway</a> is RequestProject/Statements.lean</p>\n<p>I am very grateful that you took the time again to help me correct my format to give a verifiable and auditable lean result.</p>",
