        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110087\">Kim Morrison</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/601332789\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not there yet. :-) Next, learn to use comparator, with your <code>Statements.lean</code> as the <code>Challenge.lean</code> file.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Hi Kim, thank you for being so patient with me. I checked how to run a comparator, and it seems this will take some time. While I am doing this, (I know this is a bit late to ask) is there a guide on lean verification submission that i can refer to, so i don't repeat the pattern of missing things in my submission?<br>\nThank you for your continuous support.</p>",
