        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110087\">Kim Morrison</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Selberg.20Majorant.20improvement.20With.20AI/near/601332789\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not there yet. :-) Next, learn to use comparator, with your <code>Statements.lean</code> as the <code>Challenge.lean</code> file.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I think I have everything required now. There is an audit file which prints all the theorems to show they are sorry free. A challenge.lean file which has all the theorems stated using only mathlib (with in line definitions). A solution file which imports the project. The project has been run through a comparator check. <br>\nThere is a formalization.yml file. A readme file. Use of of AI mentioned and credited.</p>",
